cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use hmd-skills, please cite it using the metadata in this file."
title: "hmd-skills: agent skills for hmd (Heimdall)"
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: RJ
    alias: randomittin
repository-code: "https://github.com/randomittin/hmd-skills"
url: "https://runheimdall.dev"
abstract: >-
  hmd-skills is a collection of five agent skills for hmd (Heimdall), a
  verification layer for AI coding agents: stack knowledge packs for Next.js,
  React Native, Spring Boot and FastAPI; a visual parity loop that matches a
  React Native screen to its design; a measured self-improvement loop for
  routing; a read-only macOS disk and memory advisor; and a confirm-gated macOS
  deep clean. Each skill is a folder with a SKILL.md.
keywords:
  - agent skills
  - AI coding agents
  - SKILL.md
  - hmd
  - Heimdall
  - stack packs
  - visual parity
  - React Native
  - macOS cleanup
